# Accepted security findings. Each entry needs a comment with the reason.

# storage-account, accepted 2026-11-04: Trivy checks queue_properties logging, which
# azurerm 5.x removed; callers send storage logs to Azure Monitor with a diagnostic
# setting on the account.
AZU-0057

# virtual-machine, accepted 2026-11-04: NSGs are applied at the subnet by the vnet
# module (associate_nsg defaults to true); Trivy only detects a NIC argument
# azurerm 5.x removed.
AZU-0068
